msgid "Servo Shield"
msgstr "Servo Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Servo Shield drives up to eight hobby servos in parallel from the OpenMV"
" Cam over I2C, using a PCA9685 servo / PWM controller."
msgstr ""
"Servo Shield mengendalikan hingga delapan servo hobi secara paralel dari "
"OpenMV Cam melalui I2C, menggunakan kontroler servo/PWM PCA9685."

